    "en": {
      "trackName": "X-Puzzle",
      "description": "X Puzzle is the classic sliding puzzle, reimagined as a beautiful wooden set. Slide maple and walnut tiles around a walnut tray and put them back in order in as few moves as you can.\n\nChoose your challenge:\n• Seven boards, from a quick 3×3 to the brand-new 10×10 with 99 tiles\n• The classic 4×4 \"15 puzzle\", plus 4×3, 5×3, 5×4 and 5×5\n\nFeatures:\n• Realistic wooden tiles, warm lighting and smooth drag-to-slide controls\n• Slide a whole row of tiles in one move\n• Every shuffle is random and always solvable\n• Game Center leaderboards and achievements, plus your personal bests on the device\n• Challenge friends in the Games app, or send them your board in iMessage\n• A playable Home Screen widget\n• Runs on iPhone, iPad, Mac and Apple Watch\n• No ads. An optional tip jar if you'd like to say thanks.\n\nThanks for playing!",
      "releaseNotes": "• On iPad with a keyboard: a new Help menu with How to Play (⌘?) and a link to the support website\n• With a keyboard connected, How to Play also explains the keyboard controls\n• Bug fixes and updates for the latest iOS and iPadOS",
