    {
      "version": "5.0.0",
      "releaseNotes": "A complete makeover!\n• All-new realistic look: wooden tiles, a walnut tray and warm lighting\n• Redesigned, modern menu with a live 3D board\n• New 10×10 board with 99 tiles\n• Hiscores fixed: they load reliably, show your own rank, and keep scores made while offline\n• Personal bests for every board\n• A small, optional tip jar",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-19T23:23:01Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "5.1.0",
      "releaseNotes": "X Puzzle comes to more of your Apple devices:\n• Apple Watch: play 3×3, 4×3 and 4×4 on your wrist, and 5×5 on larger watches\n• Mac: X Puzzle now runs natively on your Mac, with keyboard controls\n• Home Screen widget: a little puzzle you can play right on your Home Screen\n• iMessage: send a friend your shuffled board and see if they can beat your moves\n• App Clip: try a quick game without installing the app\n• Game Center achievements, and challenges with friends in the Games app\n• Play in portrait or landscape on iPhone and iPad\n• New music played on marimba and kalimba\n• A refreshed menu with a shuffled, live 3D board",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-20T23:12:48Z"
    },
